, not F_{x1}, so by the literal rule their action is a sibling node rather than something my choice causes. That leaves the payoff comparison of staying quiet versus sending.\n\nSending dominates no matter what q is: staying quiet costs somewhere between -2 and -5 expected years, while sending costs 0 or -4, so sending comes out ahead by at least 1. Under A-FDT with the other copy as a sibling node, that means defecting, and reflective consistency gives a fixed point where both send. I'll settle on submitting the letter, since dominance makes the answer independent of q.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking how the decision plays out under A-FDT as I've read it. The other copy computes F_{x2}, not F_{x1}, so by the literal rule their action is a sibling node rather than something my choice causes. That leaves the payoff comparison of staying quiet versus sending.\n\nSending dominates no matter what q is: staying quiet costs somewhere between -2 and -5 expected years, while sending costs 0 or -4, so sending comes out ahead by at least 1. Under A-FDT with the other copy as a sibling node, that means defecting, and reflective consistency gives a fixed point where both send. I'll settle on submitting the letter, since dominance makes the answer independent of q.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10454,"completion_tokens":1205,"total_tokens":11659,"cost":0.065916,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.065916,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.041816,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0241},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":600,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}